      "text": "* Introducing Shared Collections! You can now share perma-links to Spaces, Folders, Split Views, and selected tabs to anyone, on any browser. Right click on any Folder, Split View, or selected tab group in your sidebar and click the \"Share\" option. To share Spaces, hover over your Space title and click \"Share\". Anyone, with any browser, can view the link. Arc members can add the Shared Collection to their sidebar.",
